 Native execution history makes this balance depend on more than visible formulas or declarations. An additional scope can change the solving path selected by Z3's combined solver~\cite{z3api}, and earlier requests can alter heuristics and resource counters. A proof assistant also retains elaborator state and mutable runtime extensions beyond its immutable declaration environment~\cite{lean4,repl}. A logically equivalent reconstructed context therefore requires a separate argument for observable verification behavior.
 
